  <refsect1 id="examples">
    <title>Examples</title>
    <para>
<programlisting>
xdg-terminal
</programlisting>
      Opens the user's default terminal emulator, just starting an interactive shell.
    </para>
    <para>
<programlisting>
xdg-terminal -- top
</programlisting>
      Opens the user's default terminal emulator and lets it run the top executable.
    </para>
    <para>
<programlisting>
xdg-terminal --app-id htop --title Htop -- htop
</programlisting>
      Opens htop in a new terminal similar to how an application starter would have configured it. Note: New application ids should follow the reverse domain notation, for example <code>org.example.appname</code>.
    </para>
  </refsect1>
</refentry>
